      "type": "text",
      "text": "Myelosuppression (anemia · leukopenia · pancytopenia · thrombocytopenia), reverses on stopping. Periph & optic neuropathy, mainly beyond 28 days. Hypoglycemia in diabetics on insulin or PO agents"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
