    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Serotonin syndrome (incl fatal) w SSRIs · SNRIs · TCAs · buspirone · triptans · opioids incl. meperidine. Enhanced pressor response w pseudoephedrine & other indirect sympathomimetics · vasopressors or dopaminergic drugs"
